#' Review cells or a region
#'
#' Reviews cells of a segmentation (by ID or row), the cells chosen, or a region, recorded in
#' the project with its provenance: who, the action, the value before and after, when, the
#' segmentation, the label set, each cell's label and its confidence as shown, and the
#' post-Xenium images' alignments in use. Actions: accept (the label, or a region's class),
#' relabel (a new label, with a reason; a region is reclassed), ambiguous (with the labels it
#' could be), exclude (from analyses, with a reason; a region's cells too unless cells_too is
#' false), include (again), concern (its segmentation looks wrong: merged, split, boundary,
#' not-a-cell, missed or other), resolve (the concern) and comment. Accepting and relabeling
#' cells append to the curated set begun from the label set reviewed. Answers the review.
#'
#' @param action accept, relabel, ambiguous, exclude, include, concern, resolve or comment.
#' Required; a string.
#' @param alternatives ambiguous: the labels it could be. Optional; a vector of strings
#' (Python: a list).
#' @param by Who reviews (the client's name if not given). Optional; a string.
#' @param cells Cells by ID (as the segmentation names them), or row as "#123". Optional; a
#' vector of strings (Python: a list).
#' @param cells_too Excluding a region: its cells too (true if not given). Optional; TRUE or
#' FALSE (Python: True or False).
#' @param chosen The cells chosen (the instrument's), instead. Optional; TRUE or FALSE (Python:
#' True or False).
#' @param concern concern: merged, split, boundary, not-a-cell, missed or other. Optional; a
#' string.
#' @param dataset A dataset of the project by name or id; the one in focus, else the first, if
#' not given. Optional; a string.
#' @param label relabel: the new label (or class). Optional; a string.
#' @param labels The label set reviewed (its ID; the latest if not given): for accept, relabel
#' and ambiguous. Optional; a string.
#' @param level The label set's level. Optional; a string.
#' @param note Why, or the comment (needed to relabel, exclude and comment). Optional; a
#' string.
#' @param region Or a region, by name or ID. Optional; a string.
#' @param segmentation The cells' segmentation, by name, ID or instrument (the default if not
#' given). Optional; a string.
#' @param sc A connection from sc_connect() (default: the last one made).
#' @return A situcraft_result: the message and the data SituCraft answered with.
#' @export
sc_review <- function(action, alternatives = NULL, by = NULL, cells = NULL, cells_too = NULL, chosen = NULL, concern = NULL, dataset = NULL, label = NULL, labels = NULL, level = NULL, note = NULL, region = NULL, segmentation = NULL, sc = sc_default()) {
  sc_call("review", action = action, alternatives = .sc_array(alternatives), by = by, cells = .sc_array(cells), cells_too = cells_too, chosen = chosen, concern = concern, dataset = dataset, label = label, labels = labels, level = level, note = note, region = region, segmentation = segmentation, sc = sc)
}

